flowchart TB
  Caller["Start here: caller\nGrove or another tool"]:::start
  Native["harness-dispatch\nRust command and record store"]
  Worker["Private policy worker\nCompiled Bun + TypeScript SDK"]
  Policy["Selected owner policy\nCatalog, context, selection"]
  Adapter["Optional Grove adapter\nReads only the supplied task file"]
  Harness["Configured harness\nModel + effort fixed at dispatch"]
  Caller -->|"1. Kind, prompt, context, identity"| Native
  Native -->|"2. Bounded request; no prompt or control env"| Worker
  Worker -->|"3. Evaluate explicit entry"| Policy
  Policy -.->|"Explicit import"| Adapter
  Policy -->|"4. Candidate ID + reason"| Native
  Native -->|"5. Record, then exec"| Harness
